<title>DENMARK: GN Store Nord six-month 96 profit rises.</title>
<headline>GN Store Nord six-month 96 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>					  (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Group pre-tax result		121 vs  120</p>
<p> Group net turnover		1,240 vs  929</p>
<p> Group operating result	     67 vs 70</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Danish cable-laying group is GN Store Nord A/S. It said in a statement that it expected somewhat better full year 1996 operating and ordinary pre-tax results than 1995's 107.8 million DKK and 184.3 million DKK respectively. The result was above analyst expectations.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom, 45-33-969650</p>
</text>
